From 1b792d2f87b4b8b623109c65ce7e8c9ac1a182b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Jun 2026 14:44:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 773/913] core: arm: psci: call plat_system_reset() as a
 default implementation of psci_system_reset()

Call plat_system_reset() as a default implementation of
psci_system_reset(). Since plat_system_reset() is already platform
defined, so it can be used as a default implementation of
psci_system_reset().

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 5675164bf252d6e4cae897626bfe6053c3c56a09 core: arm: psci: call plat_system_reset() as a default implementation of psci_system_reset()]
Change-Id: I2b751493e177aa5fa431a70bf85252dae424b4e5
Signed-off-by: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/578198
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/sm/psci.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/sm/psci.c b/core/arch/arm/sm/psci.c
index b9ec8de61..3f9c94350 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/sm/psci.c
+++ b/core/arch/arm/sm/psci.c
@@ -90,6 +90,7 @@ __weak void psci_system_off(void)
 
 __weak void psci_system_reset(void)
 {
+	plat_system_reset("PSCI");
 }
 
 __weak int psci_features(uint32_t psci_fid __unused)
